### Self-Service Scale API Tests

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@cardNumber = 42
@waiterToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...

---

### 1. Open Self-Service Tab
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "SELF_SERVICE",
  "cardNumber": {{cardNumber}}
}

> {%
  client.global.set("tabId", response.body.id);
  client.global.set("tabTotal", response.body.total);
%}

---

### 2. Get Tab (Verify It Was Created)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs/{{tabId}}
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}

---

### 3. Find Tab by Card Number (Should Already Exist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs?cardNumber={{cardNumber}}
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}

---

### 4. Get Public Menu (To Find Weight-Based Items)
GET http://localhost:8080/public/menu
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 5. Add Weight-Based Item to Tab
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs/{{tabId}}/items
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuItemId": "item-id-here",
  "weightGrams": 250
}

---

### 6. Verify Item Was Added (Check Total Changed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs/{{tabId}}
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}

---

### 7. Try Invalid Card (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "SELF_SERVICE",
  "cardNumber": 1000
}

---

### 8. Try Missing Card Number (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "SELF_SERVICE"
}

---

### 9. Try Creating Table-Service Tab Instead (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurant/tabs
Authorization: {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "TABLE_SERVICE",
  "cardNumber": {{cardNumber}}
}
